Package: pod5R
Title: R Interface to POD5 File Format by Oxford Nanopore Technologies
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Natalia",
           family = "Gumińska",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "nguminska@iimcb.gov.pl",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4599-2897"))
Maintainer: Natalia Gumińska <nguminska@iimcb.gov.pl>
Description: Reads Oxford Nanopore POD5 files through native POD5 C API. 
  Supports retrieving of read and run metadata, indexed read selection, 
  calibrated signal extraction, and processing without requiring Python.
